00:33:51.760 --> 00:33:53.770
But sometimes if
your dependencies

00:33:53.770 --> 00:33:59.250
live outside of Python,
then what can you do, right?

00:33:59.250 --> 00:34:01.000
That's why in this
one, we realized that--

00:34:01.000 --> 00:34:02.420
we make it a very
convenient way,

00:34:02.420 --> 00:34:06.700
backport the Kubernetes pod
operator in Airflow 1.10,

00:34:06.700 --> 00:34:09.230
which was just released
a couple of weeks back.

00:34:09.230 --> 00:34:11.789
But it also will make it
just work out of box for you.

00:34:11.789 --> 00:34:13.330
So you don't have
to worry about it--

00:34:13.330 --> 00:34:14.139
what's the service
[INAUDIBLE],, what's

00:34:14.139 --> 00:34:15.646
