00:38:44.790 --> 00:38:51.670
before they have the
logs populated for you.

00:38:51.670 --> 00:38:53.700
And now the task is done.

00:38:53.700 --> 00:38:55.730
We can take a look
at the output.

00:39:05.190 --> 00:39:09.060
As you'll notice, you'll
start a [? GKE ?] pod.

00:39:09.060 --> 00:39:12.670
And then just wait for that
[? GKE ?] pod to be done.

00:39:12.670 --> 00:39:14.970
At some point--
wait, let's see--

