I'll try to scroll over.

00:39:19.840 --> 00:39:21.120
There we go.

00:39:21.120 --> 00:39:23.070
There's a job
pending, job running,

00:39:23.070 --> 00:39:24.960
and then it prints
the value of pi.

00:39:24.960 --> 00:39:29.410
And then finally, you'll
