JAMES MALONE: Excellent.

00:40:04.720 --> 00:40:07.860
And just to add on, the security
that we use for the identity

00:40:07.860 --> 00:40:11.760
ware proxy is the same
load balancer level

00:40:11.760 --> 00:40:14.490
